                <pb facs="1040" n="882" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg882"/>

                <head>[Inclosure.—Translation.]</head>
                <p>A material error has slipped in the law of August 21, concerning the importation
                    duties, published in the Moniteur of August 22 of this year.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art</hi>. 5, second paragraph, should read: “Law of
                    June 28, 1905,” and not “of August 11, 1903.”</p>
                <p>In fact, the 4/8 of the gold surtax on importation have been applied to the
                    withdrawal of the paper money by the law of June 28, 1905.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
